{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21968","headline":"薛中丞 · 白居易","name":"薛中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百人无一直，百直无一遇。\n借问遇者谁，正人行得路。\n中丞薜存诚，守直心甚固。\n皇明烛如日，再使秉王度。\n奸豪与佞巧，非不憎且惧。\n直道渐光明，邪谋难盖覆。\n每因匪躬节，知有匡时具。\n张爲坠网纲，倚作颓檐柱。\n悠哉上天意，报施纷回互。\n自古已冥茫，从今尤不谕。\n岂与小人意，昏然同好恶。\n不然君子人，何反如朝露。\n裴相昨已夭，薛君今又去。\n以我惜贤心，五年如旦暮。\n况闻善人命，长短系运数。\n今我一涕零，岂爲中丞故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}